      "author": {
        "id": 5065
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-03-18T17:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this might be the fundamental API difference between what you\u0027re thinking and I\u0027m thinking.\n\nI\u0027m imagining all these details being private to the package, so users don\u0027t need to care about them.\n\nIf we proceed with this, we\u0027ll need better documentation anyway, so please write an example_test.go file showing users how they wire this all up in a real program. In parallel I\u0027ll write up an API (without implementation) that I\u0027m thinking of.",
      "revId": "581c96d0087f72755e11e25b62beb90990e6f992",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": false
