      "side": 1,
      "message": "I didn\u0027t see it as the client\u0027s method: it doesn\u0027t require auth, just a stateless helper method to get Endpoint from a given CA discovery URL:\nhttps://ietf-wg-acme.github.io/acme/#rfc.section.6.2\n\nIt could, however, return *acme.Client, if the latter had an Endpoint field.",
