      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-03-18T17:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "why isn\u0027t this a method on *Client? Why does this taken an *http.Client if your acme.Client already has an *http.Client?",
      "revId": "581c96d0087f72755e11e25b62beb90990e6f992",
