        "filename": "acme/acme.go",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 394,
      "author": {
        "id": 6347
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-03-21T16:08:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "An already issued cert can be fetched by anyone, e.g. using curl. This is on the same level as acme.Discover.\n\nThe reason for this to be exported package func is I thought users might find it useful to retrieve an already issued cert, also in different forms: e.g. bundled vs unbundled.\n\nSee last example of \"GET /acme/cert/asdf\" in https://ietf-wg-acme.github.io/acme/#rfc.section.6.5.\n\nBut now that you mention it, I\u0027m not sure whether it provides a real added value anymore. We could unexport it for now.",
      "parentUuid": "3c1bdab9_bb525bdd",
      "revId": "581c96d0087f72755e11e25b62beb90990e6f992",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": false
