      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-03-18T17:42:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d rather not expose RetryError at all. You can just wait here and do it for them.\n\nSo I\u0027d take a context.Context as your first parameter so the caller can cancel.",
