      "message": "Maybe these should have a specific type, so they can have methods on them, and implement the error interface. They could even implement the net.Error interface (later, if needed) to e.g. distinguish temporary vs not.",
      "revId": "581c96d0087f72755e11e25b62beb90990e6f992",
