        "id": 6347
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-03-21T16:08:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, Status is the HTTP resp status. The reason for this is we also needed other headers, like Link: ... to properly handle errors.\n\nI guess the truth is we don\u0027t know yet exactly what acme.Client should/can handle and when to let users do it. In the latter case we wanted to provide users with as many error details as possible.\n\nWDYT?",
